  "correction_rules": [
    "Reduce forecast overshoots following sharp price spikes, especially when sentiment is neutral or negative.",
    "Adjust forecasts downward if sentiment turns negative (e.g., sentiment < 0.00) and price is trending upward.",
    "Apply mean reversion bias: if forecast is significantly above recent 5-day average, reduce by 5-15% for next period.",
    "Increase downward bias when sentiment is positive (e.g., sentiment > 0.50) and price is trending downward.",
    "Correct for lag: if true outcome is significantly below forecast, reduce forecast by 10-20% for next period if sentiment remains neutral.",
    "Avoid over-optimism in early forecast periods; apply smoothing to reduce volatility in first 3-5 days of forecast horizon."
  ]
}
